      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This avatar is a good example: avtr_efc7e282-5900-4909-8440-ae27c721757e , the tail often is just pointing straight down through the floor collider, though if you reload it a few times, the tail will rest on the floor collider as normal. The floor collider for the tail used to work reliably for years (since 2023).",
