      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another good example is this boxing gloves robot: avtr_04a9d322-e228-4934-93b1-6e20b62cfded . It uses inside-out colliders to hold the gloves springs in. \n\nWith this issue, depending on the observer (yourself, other players) the left or right spring may appear sprung (the collider not working). Doing anything that reloads the avatar will randomize the results for all observers. It should not do this. At the default state of the avatar, both colliders should (and used to) remain active, keeping the gloves in.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
